{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tuk-track-api-collection",
    "name": "Tuk-Tuk Tracking API",
    "description": "RESTful API for Sri Lanka Police real-time three-wheeler tracking.\n\n**Base URL:** {{base_url}}\n**Swagger UI:** {{base_url}}/docs\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. Import this collection AND `tuk-track-api.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select the **Tuk-Tuk API (Production)** environment in the top-right dropdown\n3. Run **Auth → Login (HQ admin)** — this captures `{{access_token}}` automatically\n4. Run any other request — auth headers are populated from the environment\n\nFor the device-ingestion endpoints, run **Devices Admin → Provision Device** first; the pre-request script on `Tracking → Device Ingest` auto-signs each request using the captured `key_id` + `hmac_secret`.\n\n## Seeded credentials (deployed instance)\n\n| Email | Role | Password |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| hq.admin@police.lk | hq | Password123! |\n| wp.admin@police.lk | province (WP) | Password123! |\n| officer.colcentral@police.lk | station (Colombo Central) | Password123! |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [""]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🏥 Health",
      "item": [
